# External evaluation data — never commit.
# LongMemEval (MIT), LoCoMo (CC BY-NC 4.0), and HaluMem (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0) are
# downloaded by the operator, read from a local path, and neither the files nor
# any derivative of them belongs in this repository. The synthetic fixtures the
# adapters are tested against are invented and are named so they do not match.
